                <l xml:id="m-0968950b-45a0-412c-b5d3-fa4fe1ad74e3" facs="#m-06e6da20-84b1-4805-9098-8763738439fd" label="text-like">At Matins.</l><l xml:id="m-eec88066-cedf-4175-8d65-1eccadaf383f" facs="#m-89c29358-9698-4928-bb6a-287c5f2f1f67" label="ambiguous">a73</l><l xml:id="m-9a2ad85f-0fba-46b5-a7f3-725f90b8fc14" facs="#m-15eb8884-e8a8-4490-8c38-8874b4b5d4ef" label="lyrics-like">36. Deficiant peccatóres a térra, et iniqui ita ut non sint :* bénedie</l><l xml:id="m-9a1d61ad-19e9-4f29-a7f8-d65d0f493d87" facs="#m-96b64004-f08c-4fd0-b3b5-ab64bd7eba7e" label="lyrics-like">ánima méa Dómino.</l><l xml:id="m-db3bb6d6-f2bc-42c8-a8a5-48224026bbe4" facs="#m-e4c54b6b-6408-45d5-be7c-3796adb4d985" label="lyrics-like">37. Glória Pátri et Filio, * et Spiritut Sáncto.</l><l xml:id="m-cf8d44b4-4682-4b68-a1c8-852ecc2239cb" facs="#m-012b0a1a-22ac-4b01-930e-391d4446a19a" label="lyrics-like">38. Sicut érat in principio, et nunc et semper,“et in saécula saecu¬</l><l xml:id="m-6d8751b9-cb92-490a-9d08-79151b50737d" facs="#m-6f1251b6-3412-4295-9993-2e1d0abd9c07" label="ambiguous">torum. Amen.</l><l xml:id="m-7a308bcc-ec28-4467-9fbf-7010733c03ad" facs="#m-52994074-db33-4a5c-99be-83959e1c8d56" label="lyrics-like">V. Spíi-tus Dómini replévit órbem terrárum, alle lú-ia.</l><l xml:id="m-55f71ecc-39b7-4835-bd12-a211882f2fe9" facs="#m-7cd31d12-c51e-4d9e-8ffa-86d17e17f9ee" label="lyrics-like">K. Et hoc quod cóntinet ómnia, sciéntiam</l><l xml:id="m-1998c66a-3a85-47f1-8e8b-b21f0716a83c" facs="#m-8d210d5e-1238-4c9e-aee2-1cc981e95393" label="lyrics-like">hábet vócis, alle lú-ia¬</l><l xml:id="m-b0e235d9-aacd-41e9-aed2-246ce5e934b8" facs="#m-ac3fc64d-c0e7-4cf2-b506-871d25d1a65c" label="lyrics-like">Páter nóster.</l><l xml:id="m-99af8637-3434-4f9c-a3cc-7822fdb6d771" facs="#m-48cdaf41-3a9e-4021-807f-3e9debecddc3" label="lyrics-like">V. Et ne nos indúcas in tentatiónem.</l><l xml:id="m-66f8630d-c45f-46ea-9a69-c9e2038f607e" facs="#m-dc23fafc-ceec-463c-a8dd-2ba471584c9a" label="lyrics-like">R. Sed libera nos a málo.</l><l xml:id="m-9cd8bc4a-03c7-4c6c-a22f-afa61fe61f11" facs="#m-7d9f81b2-27a9-496b-a097-5a926d8193ee" label="lyrics-like">Absolution. Exáudi, Dómine Jésu Christe, préces servórum tuórum, t</l><l xml:id="m-1034e092-b838-465c-b878-3861df73f97c" facs="#m-4439ca3e-8c99-4cc9-81c7-c414eea86286" label="lyrics-like">et miserére nóbis :* qui cum Pâtre et Spiritu Sancto vivis et régnas in</l><l xml:id="m-1f99999c-17fc-4f8b-919e-89cdeda77c06" facs="#m-a2e588a6-f18d-4908-a9b4-e23aa2945b92" label="lyrics-like">saécula saeculórum. E. Amen.</l><l xml:id="m-78666747-97ad-4561-bb46-61de5949c992" facs="#m-c579b5d6-92aa-425a-9162-d8a884f6f81d" label="lyrics-like">The Lector. V. Júbe, dómne, benedicere.</l><l xml:id="m-0f62e80a-15c2-469d-be76-2c2e9fa086c1" facs="#m-59fe4836-d407-404a-b5c0-11827598b7d0" label="lyrics-like">Blessing. Evangélica léctio* sit nóbis sálus et protéctio.</l><l xml:id="m-d65ac83a-f731-4587-ab06-31a0f209da26" facs="#m-4138f75f-a28f-4a7e-9a78-5ee2b43e83ef" label="ambiguous">E. Amen.</l><l xml:id="m-f0f13fa9-6563-4c6e-9ca8-07147e290ca2" facs="#m-461b3c52-c3df-437e-ab79-d715de08affd" label="lyrics-like">Léctio sancti Evangélii secúndum Joánnem.</l><l xml:id="m-5ca9247c-f0cb-466e-b119-3199452a45d1" facs="#m-115049a9-f573-42bf-98a0-bafd85a62565" label="ambiguous">Lesson I.</l><l xml:id="m-9bd0ec8a-dc72-4c45-99e8-d39ef549e720" facs="#m-db28b985-f499-42f1-b28d-8bd8a847a0d1" label="ambiguous">Cap. 14. c.</l><l xml:id="m-ca0e23b5-5e9c-4a4e-b6e2-fd8a4df1dbb2" facs="#m-af1b9cee-332e-4adb-bc9b-41e4a04472a6" label="lyrics-like">TN illo témpore: Dixit Jesus disci-] meus diliget eum, et ad eum venié¬</l><l xml:id="m-0b6b31ef-3dee-4d0f-a117-e6824dd9a69a" facs="#m-5b1d7ec3-4afd-4ccf-a725-93f93c47eda1" label="lyrics-like">L pulis suis: Si quis diligit me,l mus, et mansiónem apud eum fa¬</l><l xml:id="m-3eec866b-6a14-453a-83ab-2684c89467c1" facs="#m-bb880eef-39f3-4b40-bfc7-44ded1f5c2cd" label="lyrics-like">sermónem meum servábit, et Pater lciémus. Et réliqua.</l><l xml:id="m-da0c3f6b-200c-491c-88cd-68a6772d6115" facs="#m-8a53bbd5-eda2-448c-b09d-a3dfa743b500" label="lyrics-like">Homilia sancti Gregórii Papae.</l><l xml:id="m-77a71504-4c80-4dc0-8d52-5c5b48ac0dc3" facs="#m-7b5014b6-423e-4c3f-b4eb-c0c33b815440" label="ambiguous">Homilia 30. in Evangelia.</l><l xml:id="m-46208321-4656-4ddb-b2c4-664a8ecfac49" facs="#m-187fb338-3b8b-428a-88be-744d812797e7" label="lyrics-like">Ibet, fratres carissimi, Evangé-l ignis visióne suscepérunt, per amc¬</l><l xml:id="m-f114fc6d-f60e-4a29-b8a6-4b991957fb38" facs="#m-7e6de4a9-5961-4e33-81b7-0503b7ae47f8" label="lyrics-like">I licae verba lectiónis sub brevi¬</l><l xml:id="m-eda092d0-6847-4b73-a7e7-ae1bad41b3ce" facs="#m-760129be-1b93-47fc-b90e-cc24f88b7296" label="lyrics-like">rem suáviter arsérunt. Ipse namque</l><l xml:id="m-90143bf8-e3e1-408e-bec5-ef49840c5a97" facs="#m-9452565f-d9cc-43c1-8332-5cfe30337951" label="lyrics-like">Spíritus Sanctus amor est : unde et</l><l xml:id="m-92368e6f-a3ac-4c26-b007-90bf42445287" facs="#m-3aa1f485-3445-44bd-9d20-7f5c5c0224d3" label="lyrics-like">táte transcúrrere, ut post diútius</l><l xml:id="m-cde8bb6e-d7f1-4fd1-b1d6-1eba360ab018" facs="#m-9eb829f7-426a-4c5a-8b50-dda632e64a2a" label="lyrics-like">Joánnes dicit : Deus cáritas est.</l><l xml:id="m-2242cc65-3e81-4dd2-9d03-4096735bc7b4" facs="#m-6998dc18-6d02-4067-b0ff-2b6e88d5f37c" label="lyrics-like">liceat in contemplatiône tantae</l><l xml:id="m-676ae525-63c7-428d-9e27-63ddb1f3bcfc" facs="#m-b645cb87-fb50-4c98-b440-106a8a308efe" label="lyrics-like">Qui ergo mente integra Deum desí¬</l><l xml:id="m-6e518cdc-8aab-422b-a24e-b53cf0185721" facs="#m-3edec814-ba29-4dba-bd8d-ea8e46534196" label="lyrics-like">solemnitátis immorári. Hódie nam¬</l><l xml:id="m-2e274e78-2bd3-4546-9dc6-f8f5c7534784" facs="#m-d0bb0e53-ceb9-498c-9ac6-5a750a03d0ad" label="lyrics-like">derat, profécto jam habet quem</l><l xml:id="m-ddaafa79-31b4-4e15-95f6-340e9f53cff0" facs="#m-7e418fb2-b40f-4952-9726-620cab77c9c0" label="lyrics-like">que Spiritus Sanctus repentíno só¬</l><l xml:id="m-f15709ea-87a8-47cc-bf64-68e9e37e955c" facs="#m-da8c04a4-ea81-4907-963b-a41c849a5a91" label="lyrics-like">nitu super discipulos venit, mentés¬</l><l xml:id="m-b7c52e70-a16c-482e-964a-271746ac1a81" facs="#m-a1e79de3-33de-4cd6-a2e8-7089881b7d14" label="ambiguous">amat. Neque enim quisquam posset</l><l xml:id="m-1109817c-bf23-4f45-9f87-ac39c5fe1128" facs="#m-def6fece-6ef4-4d28-bec8-a2179628fa7a" label="ambiguous">Deum diligere, si eum quem diligit,</l><l xml:id="m-9ed2bd55-1170-4e97-b75a-d1f9054302c0" facs="#m-bcc4c9c3-77bb-4b2f-b4e4-f9027b20cdab" label="lyrics-like">que carnálium in sui amórem per¬</l><l xml:id="m-a51127db-5e9c-4590-be34-8f6d5c20e94a" facs="#m-38ad665f-d3aa-479e-9d4a-7651f6fcd3b1" label="lyrics-like">non habéret. Tu autem, Dómine,</l><l xml:id="m-a26aab7c-c55f-44c9-885b-287c2d704394" facs="#m-34513a4f-417d-49f1-8b2d-3fed8ec69655" label="lyrics-like">mutávit, et foris apparéntibus lin¬</l><l xml:id="m-5a122284-97a6-4282-8262-1258a0d3b6b8" facs="#m-2caa4633-98d4-4085-8b7f-628cec48f12c" label="lyrics-like">miserére nobis.</l><l xml:id="m-71d86b22-ee4a-478a-89b6-8a509979d835" facs="#m-53b2edea-e36c-4f53-a53f-b7dd9080accc" label="ambiguous">guis igneis, intus facta sunt corda</l><l xml:id="m-63afc226-369c-42a7-a8ba-9753dc1ac805" facs="#m-ff3984ed-781b-4b61-823d-5ffe0bcb08b9" label="lyrics-like">R. Deo grátias.</l><l xml:id="m-a3e9bade-badf-4a29-bf05-9752990d7933" facs="#m-40867ea3-90e2-4109-bb13-00facbc4de7c" label="lyrics-like">Hammántia: quia dum Deum in</l><l xml:id="m-24cb287c-82e2-4ba4-9be6-6641d9379eb1" facs="#m-d504702c-d8f5-40e4-b319-793f2900550c" label="ambiguous">Resp.</l><l xml:id="m-fe8e83d3-0110-430a-9276-edddfb954a3e" facs="#m-5fced632-9b0e-48cc-9386-a8911fd12d45" label="ambiguous">3.</l><l xml:id="m-86c9f246-0101-4e78-b610-26be32380282" facs="#m-57fac242-0340-4793-91b6-ffae7f900d33" label="ambiguous" /><l xml:id="m-1e3514e1-7d70-432f-8417-2a6f0967e677" facs="#m-805bf926-9b8e-48e2-a5f6-4ff08f7406e0" label="lyrics-like">UM comple réntur</l><l xml:id="m-104fc3e6-3d3d-4565-9bd4-9f153a0db1a9" facs="#m-f0e5045b-b651-41c6-b168-c52ad0768a07" label="lyrics-like">dí¬</l><l xml:id="m-88b135db-8748-4146-9732-b0b8ae8d1952" facs="#m-cd22ea4f-34ef-4650-bd34-a9003078a90c" label="lyrics-like">es “Pen-te-có¬</l><l xml:id="m-163430e6-99dc-43f9-8035-2d46113caaa1" facs="#m-f673fad4-0934-4f10-874a-44ec1721e73d" label="ambiguous">stes,</l><l xml:id="m-ebf8874a-d058-4edd-9cef-eaefb2c79a37" facs="#m-642b6324-bdec-43b7-96c7-56d11bc41ca2" label="lyrics-like">é- rant ómnes pá¬ ri-ter</l><l xml:id="m-7a4bde99-75c1-46de-b872-0cb27c4a3809" facs="#m-e72c9689-f258-432e-bccc-c2c5cb5ec499" label="lyrics-like">in e-ódem</l></lg>
            </div>
          </section>
        </score>
      </mdiv>
    </body>
